[34.470315, "o", "Dear Customer,\r\n\r\nThank you for reaching out to us regarding order **CYM-EC-9921**. \r\n\r\nI sincerely apologize for the delay in your package's delivery. Your order is currently delayed due to a severe winter storm impacting operations and transit routes at our East Coast fulfillment center. We understand how frustrating delivery delays can be, especially when you are eagerly awaiting your items, and we truly appreciate your patience while teams work under challenging weather conditions to keep shipments moving safely.\r\n\r\nAs a valued **Gold tier** member, we want to make things right:\r\n- We have applied a **$50 credit** directly to your Cymbal Direct account.\r\n- We have upgraded your order's shipping method to **Next-Day Air** at no additional charge to ensure your package arrives as swiftly as possible once transit safely resumes.\r\n\r\nThank you so much for your continued loyalty as a Gold member. If you have any further questions or if there is anything else we can do to assist you, please do not hesitate to reach out.\r\n\r\nWarm regards,  \r\n**Cymbal Direct Customer Care**"]
